# The CLI uploads the working directory, and without this it sends the whole
# monorepo -- 460MB of dependencies and build output, which fails the 100MB
# limit. Vercel installs and builds from source on its own machines, so none
# of this is wanted there.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.git
*.log
.env.local
